OL,3,GNEWSAFour in hospital after Bromley
OL,4,Astabbing
OL,5,
OL,6,FFour people have been taken to hospital
OL,7,Ffollowing a stabbing in Bromley High
OL,8,FStreet, London Ambulance Service has
OL,9,Fconfirmed.
OL,11,FParamedics attended alongside the
OL,12,FLondon Air Ambulance at 14:19 BST on
OL,13,FThursday.
OL,15,FThe high street is currently closed
OL,16,Fboth ways from Ringers Road to
OL,17,FEthelbert Road.
OL,23,APub: 10-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
